      "purpose": "Provides suspense-mode helper utilities for preact-query integrating TanStack Query core, handling error throwing, timer clamping, and optimistic fetch orchestration.",
      "summary": "This module exports pure and side-effecting functions that adapt TanStack Query behaviour for Preact Suspense. It defines a predicate to throw when query data is missing, ensures staleTime and gcTime respect a 1000ms minimum in suspense mode to avoid refetch storms, and supplies helpers to decide when to fetch or suspend and to run optimistic fetches while clearing error boundaries on failure.",
      "businessContext": "Enables Suspense-based data fetching in Preact apps via TanStack Query. Failure causes excessive refetches or incorrect suspense throwing.",
